Rāma questions Agastya about unopposed Rāvaṇa --- Agastya tells Rāvaṇa harassing kings earthwide --- Rāvaṇa reaches Māhiṣmatī seeking Arjuna battle --- Ministers report Arjuna sporting at Narmadā --- Rāvaṇa views Vindhya and reaches Narmadā --- Rāvaṇa boasts sun wind river fear him --- Ministers bathe and heap flower mountain --- Rāvaṇa bathes worships golden liṅga dancing